#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "\"{NAME_APP}\" mobile and web applications are developed and operated by Vadym Bezsmertnyi, Sole Proprietor (Ukraine) (\"us\", \"we\", or \"our\"). By accessing or using our AI-powered educational market analysis app and web services (\"Service\"), you (the User) agree to abide by and be bound by these Terms of Use. Please read these terms carefully before using the service."
