#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "{NAME_APP} is an AI-powered mobile and web application designed to provide educational market analysis, learning insights, and information for studying XAU/USD (Gold/US Dollar) market behavior. The application offers real-time market data, AI-generated educational insights, technical indicators, pattern recognition, and analytical tools to help users understand market analysis concepts. The service is intended for informational and educational purposes only."
